sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant NATS as NATS JetStream
    participant Worker as Worker
    participant Events as Event service
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant Eval as Rule evaluator

    NATS->>Worker: Fetch delivery from the events stream
    Worker->>Worker: Decode EventEnvelope

    alt Invalid envelope
        Worker->>DB: Save quarantine entry with source hash
        Worker->>NATS: NakWithDelay 5s
    else Valid envelope
        Worker->>Events: Process(envelope)
        Events->>DB: BEGIN transaction
        Events->>DB: Insert inbox entry tenant_id, event_id
        alt Duplicate event
            Events->>DB: Read existing execution
            Events->>DB: COMMIT
            Events-->>Worker: Existing execution
            Worker->>NATS: Ack
        else New event
            Events->>DB: Read activation for tenant and rule set
            Events->>DB: Read active rule revision
            Events->>Eval: Evaluate(revision, event)
            Eval-->>Events: Decision with matched rules and effects
            Events->>DB: Save execution with decision hash
            Events->>DB: Insert durable outbox effects
            Events->>DB: Mark inbox committed and execution completed
            Events->>DB: COMMIT
            Events-->>Worker: Execution
            Worker->>NATS: Ack only after commit
        end
    end

    Note over DB: Unique tenant_id + event_id prevents<br/>duplicate business execution.<br/>No active rule set returns ErrRuleNotActive<br/>and the delivery is retried, not acked.
